	Final words

	Quest and Account ED are my favourite doors which is a
	unbelievable help for all sysops. The reason why it took so long
	for the V1.10 update were that I was not sure wether I should
	include a simple account editor into the Quest package or include
	the Quest sysops command into Account ED. Well after making AccED
	such a powerfull util with the latest updates there was no questions
	about it and I slowly began making Account ED quest compatible.
	Today Account ED is 100% Quest compatible and serves the purpose
	even better becouse of the much more fast code in Account ED and
	to the fact that it has never been more easy to upgrade a new user
	or look at an old users account. So I feel very proud to bring you
	this update and hopes it adds on to the family of well known doors!

	These are some other doors that I've made, Account ED, Sysop Uploader,
	File Comment, Virtual Vote, Connect, Node Activities, News mag,
	Log Viewer, Config Ed (BBS:ConfigX), Virtual Chart, LastCallers Util
	DirXCleaner, MailServer (DNET), Members and Password Fail!

	If I get the chance I hope to have a chat with you at a party,
	maybe at Computer Crossroads or at European Computer Conference,
	invitation text to the last party is supplied within this archive!
	I would be gratefull if you called my board and come with complaints,
	ideas or whatever you may come up with on all my doors!

